        <p class="lede">At PwC, I designed how an IT assistant finds the technical guidance it needs to answer questions and keeps that knowledge current as the original documentation changes. I also developed an AI agent that carries out service tickets in an operator’s browser. The operator can review a proposed change, provide input, or take over, then let the agent continue.</p>
