        <p>After approving an action, the operator still needs to know whether it succeeded and what changed. I kept the ticket as the record of that work. The agent checks the application’s confirmation and records the outcome alongside its actions and the person’s interventions, so the operator can return to the dashboard and review how the request was resolved.</p>
      </section>

